{"id":"3c204d52497e7421","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-hypersimple.md","title":"超简单可枚举集","display":"df-hypersimple — 超简单可枚举集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-hypersimple","aliases":["43-df-hypersimple"],"display":"df-hypersimple — 超简单可枚举集","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.14, hypersimplicity paragraph; §5.17","source_printed_pages":"59,68","source_pdf_pages":"79,88","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-hypersimple"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-hypersimple</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hypersimple — 超简单可枚举集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a33ab576c20ae1c1\" href=\"?note=a33ab576c20ae1c1\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-set\">43-df-hyperimmune-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.14, hypersimplicity paragraph; §5.17"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"59,68"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"79,88"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a33ab576c20ae1c1\" href=\"?note=a33ab576c20ae1c1\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-set\">43-df-hyperimmune-set</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(A)\\iff\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(A)\\iff\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补集无穷性来自HyperimmuneSet定义，不能省成仅对有限数组的条件。Hypersimple是集合性质，并非“超免疫Turing度的c.e.代表”这一更弱条件。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，§5.14, hypersimplicity paragraph; §5.17，印刷页59,68，PDF页79,88。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-set","status":"resolved","id":"a33ab576c20ae1c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{CE}$ 采用 [[43-df-ce]]，$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$ 采用 [[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-set","status":"resolved","id":"a33ab576c20ae1c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{CE}$ 采用 [[43-df-ce]]，$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$ 采用 [[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(A)\\iff\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A).","display":true}],"bytes":1303,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-hypersimple]] — 超简单可枚举集"},{"id":"9167d626040602f0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Hypersimple}$、$\\operatorname{Simple}$、$\\operatorname{Immune}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-hypersimple]]、[[43-df-immune]]；强数组见 [[43-df-strong-array]]。"},{"id":"28be58b6787f49ee","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Hypersimple}$、$\\le_{wtt}$、$\\varnothing\\prime$ 采用 [[43-df-hypersimple]]、[[43-df-wtt]]、[[43-df-jump]]。"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","a33ab576c20ae1c1"]}